d-atlas/nebraska/grant-county"],["ARC or PLC in Grant County","/arc-plc/nebraska/grant-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 12 grids came in under 90% of normal in January to February in 38 of the 75 years since 1951. In 2025, the middle of the grids ran 48% of normal in October to November and 27% in November to December. So far in 2026, February to March and March to April each came in at 24% on the middle of the grids. Grid 25912 had its driest year in 2012 at 44%.</p>"}
